parameters.description:
A hash containing arrays of create/update/delete operations:
{
  "create": [
    { "name": "New Group A" },
    { "name": "New Group B" }
  ],
  "update": [
    { "id": 123, "name": "Updated Group Name A" },
    { "id": 456, "name": "Updated Group Name B" }
  ],
  "delete": [
    { "id": 789 },
    { "id": 101 }
  ]
}
